>>__ load "simpExtLib";
>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `safe_solver_ss`

``` hol4
simpExtLib.safe_solver_ss : TraverseExt.ssolver -> simpExtLib.ssfrag
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Creates an anonymous extension fragment containing one safe solver.
Installing it has the same effect as `add_safe_solver`.

### Failure

Never fails.

### Example

``` hol4
>> val c = Context.snapshot();
>> val decide : TraverseExt.ssolver = {name = "decide", solve = K DECIDE};
>>_ val ext_bool_ss = simpExtLib.lift_simpset boolSimps.bool_ss;
>>_ val ss = simpExtLib.++
     (ext_bool_ss,simpExtLib.safe_solver_ss decide);
>> simpExtLib.GEN_SIMP_TAC {safe = true} ss [] ([], “x < x + 1”) c;
```

### See also

[`simpExtLib.add_safe_solver`](#simpExtLib.add_safe_solver),
[`simpExtLib.solver_ss`](#simpExtLib.solver_ss).
